cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use d-raft in published work, please cite this software."
title: "d-raft: Portable semantic counterexamples for Raft"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mohammadamin
    family-names: Khanbabaei
    alias: aminkbi
    website: "https://github.com/aminkbi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aminkbi/d-raft"
url: "https://github.com/aminkbi/d-raft"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  d-raft is a deterministic research platform for producing replayable and
  independently checkable Raft executions. It provides a pure Raft reference
  state machine, virtual time, explicit durable persistence barriers, a
  faultable network, safety witnesses, semantic decision tapes, and versioned
  observational traces.
keywords:
  - Raft
  - consensus
  - distributed systems
  - deterministic simulation
  - fault injection
  - reproducibility
